usage: echo_agent.py [-h] [--port PORT] [--host HOST] [--name NAME]
                     [--behavior {echo,upper,reverse}]
                     [--stream-chunks STREAM_CHUNKS]
                     [--stream-delay-ms STREAM_DELAY_MS]
                     [--public-url PUBLIC_URL]

Testbed echo A2A agent

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --port PORT
  --host HOST
  --name NAME
  --behavior {echo,upper,reverse}
  --stream-chunks STREAM_CHUNKS
  --stream-delay-ms STREAM_DELAY_MS
  --public-url PUBLIC_URL
                        Externally-reachable base URL to advertise in the
                        Agent Card (e.g. a cloudflared/ngrok tunnel). Defaults
                        to http://host:port/.
